OL,3,GNEWSAWork to begin on #3.7m leisure
OL,4,Acentre revamp
OL,5,
OL,6,FWork on a #3.7m redevelopment of a
OL,7,Fleisure centre in New Mills will start
OL,8,Fat the end of November, the borough
OL,9,Fcouncil has said.
OL,11,FThe revamp of MyActive New Mills will
OL,12,Finclude expanding the gym to provide an
OL,13,Fadditional 20 equipment spaces and the
OL,14,Fcreation of a new multi-use studio and
OL,15,Fcommunity wellness suite.
OL,17,FThe building, in Hyde Bank Road, will
OL,18,Falso get a new-look reception area, a
OL,19,Frefurbished spin studio and dry
OL,20,Fchanging area, and new bike parking
OL,21,Fhoops and shelter.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,363,360,200,160,0,100
