OL,3,GNEWSAWork to begin on #3.7m leisure
OL,4,Acentre revamp
OL,5,
OL,6,FHigh Peak Borough Council said the work
OL,7,Fwill lead to phased temporary closures
OL,8,Fof the centre with some service levels
OL,9,Fbeing "maintained throughout".
